1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,680
W: I noticed you walking out of the subway station this morning when I was driving to work.

2
00:00:05,370 --> 00:00:06,340
Where is your car?

3
00:00:06,970 --> 00:00:08,365
M: Oh, I left it at home.

4
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:13,665
I've decided to take the subway to work from today because I can't afford to drive it every day.

5
00:00:14,890 --> 00:00:16,010
W: I know what you mean.

6
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:19,805
The prices of gas and parking are way too high these days.

7
00:00:20,230 --> 00:00:22,535
And insurance, that's another story.

8
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:28,265
In fact, it's so bad that I have been seriously thinking of selling my car.

9
00:00:28,975 --> 00:00:33,950
M: Well, you should think about taking the subway to work too then, because it's not as bad as you think it is.

10
00:00:34,470 --> 00:00:38,800
In fact, I kind of enjoy reading the paper and not having to worry about driving.
